  <description promeva:title="Subtitle" promeva:type="3" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia ACJR 2026</narrative>
  </description>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">There is rising food insecurity and malnutrition and disease outbreaks due to severe drought and conflict with increased displacement driving increased protection needs in Bosaso and Galkayo districts. There are major gaps in coverage of health and nutrition services to cope with the impact of drought on morbidity particularly on women and children, who have specific health and nutrition needs.</narrative>
  </description>
